data: {"id": "1bd9737cf0984a79-final", "run_id": "1bd9737cf0984a79", "seq": 5535, "ts_ms": 1788773319156, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态，未启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 状态为 `Pending` | 确认异常实体的当前生命周期状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (`fact-c4426602aa48`) | 直接指出导致挂载失败的具体对象缺失原因 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Container `app` 配置引用了名为 `input` 的 Volume (`fact-2c302eb33d0d`, `fact-ae76d392c0e3`, `fact-b1ccabc5610d`) | 确认异常实体内部存在挂载该 Volume 的配置依赖 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1, 标签 `reason: ContainerCreating` (`fact-f4314c20c7f7`) | 从指标层面交叉验证 Pod 正卡在启动前的等待阶段 |\n\n上述证据链逻辑一致：K8s 事件明确指出了配置依赖缺失（ConfigMap `unavailable-config`），导致 K8s 状态机停滞在 `Pending`（状态）和 `ContainerCreating`（原因），且未触发任何重启行为（重启计数为 0），确认为初始化阶段的阻塞性错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 失败 → MountVolume.SetUp failed 持续报错 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **ConfigMap 缺失**。\n\nPod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 在 spec 中配置引用了名为 `input` 的 Volume，但该 Volume 关联的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在。由于挂载该 Volume 的配置要求必须存在，kubelet 在初始化阶段无法完成卷挂载，导致 Pod 永久阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。此结论由 K8s 事件 `FailedMount`（`fact-c4426602aa48`）直接证实，并由指标 `waiting_reason=ContainerCreating`（`fact-f4314c20c7f7`）予以支撑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 79.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 41.7s (Evidence 33.7s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 130.463, "metrics": {"run_id": "1bd9737cf0984a79", "mttr": {"value": "2.2m", "seconds": 130.46927404403687, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 130469.27404403687, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 127941.60628318787, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 5611.492156982422, "tool_wall_d